{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいがブログに変な写真\n載っけてるう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの瞬間の顔は楽しそうに見えない\nかもしれないけど、\nめっちゃはしゃいでたなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかまいまいとは、\n人中ビームもそうだけど変な遊び\nばっかしてる気がするなあ( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ\nふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も昔のフォルダ見返してみた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらこんなものが..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndのリハ？の休憩中に\nまいまいが描いてくれた似顔絵。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あごこちょこちょされてるときの\n顔なんだって。似てる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい、また描いてね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校野球ってどう思いますか？\n坊主ってかっこいいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校野球って響きもイメージも\nすごい爽やか！な感じ。\n坊主かっこいいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目的地に行くときに携帯の\nマップをすごく頼ったりする？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんな便利なもの使わないわけには\nいかないね。最初からマップ\n使えばよかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買い物は一人派なのかなー？\nてか雑貨で何買ったの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人派:D\n見ただけ。でも満足！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近メンバーと遊んでないの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーやねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト終わってから\n会ってないから会いたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂メンバーはやっぱり\nHTC J butterfly を使ってる人が\n多いんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなHTC J持ってる♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際コメはどんくらいまで\n見ているんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部読んでます。\n質問はその時に読んで反映されてる\nところまでなるべく返して、後で\n反映された分もちゃんと読んでるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズムのMVで、ホントは\n女役と男役どっちがやりたかった？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男。だから嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"古着系好きだけど、男性の服が\n古着系だったらどう思います？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ話したいなあって思うし\n買い物一人派だけど、\n一緒に買い物行ったら\n楽しいだろうなあって思う^^\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もいい天気だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブラウス PAR ICI\nカーディガン bulle de savon"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デニム JOURNAL STANDARD\n靴下 靴下屋\n靴 reppeto"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鞄についてる坊やはオリバーって\nいうんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/08/4172885/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足元ちゃんと見えないけど\nザ乃木坂！って感じ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身写真朝お兄ちゃん起こして\n無理やり頼んで撮ってもらいました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はどんな服着よう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}